OL,3,GNEWSA#600,000 cuts to libraries dropped
OL,4,Aafter review
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said the proposed savings had
OL,7,F"proved difficult to achieve while
OL,8,Fmaintaining the key role that libraries
OL,9,Fplay in our neighbourhoods".
